  <item>
    <title>08 ACG厌女文化分析女博主分享，女博主分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6935a1074ef12f9fe9676ed6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6935a1074ef12f9fe9676ed6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Dec 2025 15:52:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;开场引入：本期轻松聊但议题严肃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 米哈游“大丽花”争议：崩坏星穹铁道新角色命名撞车“黑色大丽花”案，批评消费死者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> &nbsp;米哈游厌女“惯犯”盘点：菈乌玛、丰县案、蓝可儿案等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> &nbsp;逍遥散人塌房全过程：被质疑背刺女性并未发表回应，大量女粉脱粉，商单被冲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> &nbsp;商家态度与女性消费力：vivo拒不割席并置顶辱女评论，反思女性抵制为何被轻视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> &nbsp;女性博主推荐：赛万味超人、沃玛、怒九，女性创作者的乌托邦与陪伴感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> &nbsp;DM袋喵塌房全记录：发布不良图片，使用AI道歉，并在直播道歉不管骂女学员的弹幕，最终引发退款潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> &nbsp;个人经历与情绪出口：坚持画画，用攻击性的画疏解情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> &nbsp;结尾：鼓励姐妹继续追梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kiroro - 未来へ</span></p><span></span><p><span>Betsy RoseWomansong Chorus - Battle Hymn of Women</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎姐妹们在评论区分享自己的看法，感谢姐妹们的支持！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ec491cacf04fccbbf5a341/lgxE8px62ku__hP1L_xXcI_2tqlA.m4a" length="26379736" type="audio/mp4"/>
