  <item>
    <title>05 女子加起来就是好--《好东西》姐妹座谈会（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67515adea314b553c6587dca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67515adea314b553c6587dca</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2024 08:10:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好，欢迎来到思想的星河，这是一档关于女性自我成长和觉醒的电台节目，我是主播兔耳辰</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我进步了不少，终于学会了怎么做时间轴啦，姐妹们可以挑选感兴趣的位置跳转收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期您将会看到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我和钱老师的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>钱老师印象深刻的前两个画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>对电影中声音蒙太奇的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>电影中饭桌场景讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>给年轻人机会名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>小孩上场前以及小孩令我羡慕的原生家庭讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>电影中不一样的关系，铁梅和小叶的拥抱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>海报中铁梅和小叶cos的人物介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>没有架子的邵导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>月经的讨论，我和钱老师与月经相关的事迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>女性作品要先被看见再被挑选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3039">50:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>平淡作品也很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>部分女性被困于单一女性角色，《好东西》提供新思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">1:00:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>最后的小分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢姐妹们的收听！</span></p>]]></description>
